      "approved": false,
      "findings": {
        "critical": 0,
        "major": 1,
        "minor": 0,
        "suggestion": 0
      },
      "summary": "The identity check rejects a replacement basis object, but caller-owned mutable evidence can change in place while retaining the same reference. That leaves a reachable path to submitting a request based on evidence that is no longer current.",
      "findingList": [
        {
          "severity": "major",
          "file": "backend/AirlineDemo.Api/Investigation/AssessmentStore.cs",
          "line": 31,
          "message": "Reference equality does not detect in-place changes to the current basis. Snapshot or otherwise prevent mutation of basis contents so the submission check covers the evidence that was validated.",
          "confidence": 0.82,
          "category": "security",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "AssessmentBasis.Documents is an IReadOnlyDictionary backed by a caller-owned mutable dictionary. Assess validates claims against that dictionary before calling RunIfCurrent; the check only compares object references.",
            "failureScenario": "Assess validates a claim against a cited page. Before submission, another caller removes or changes that page in the backing dictionary and calls SetCurrentBasis with the same AssessmentBasis instance. ReferenceEquals still succeeds, so the inbox can create a request for evidence the current basis no longer supports (OWASP A08:2025)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "agentId": "security-reviewer",
      "reviewType": "security",
      "harness": "codex",
      "harnessVersion": "0.162.0",
      "model": "gpt-6-luna",
      "approved": true,
      "findings": {
        "critical": 0,
        "major": 0,
        "minor": 0,
        "suggestion": 0
      },
      "summary": "The round-six change makes RunIfCurrent require the exact stored basis instance, so replacing it with different contents under the same ID and version no longer allows submission from the captured basis. I found no new reachable security defect in the delta.",
      "findingList": []
    }
  ],
